OL,3,AGrindr to pay #26m to settle claims it
OL,4,Aallegedly shared users' HIV status
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrindr has agreed to pay #26m to settle
OL,7,Fa lawsuit over allegations it shared
OL,8,Fusers' personal information - including
OL,9,Ftheir HIV status - with third parties.
OL,11,FThe world's largest LGBTQ+ dating app
OL,12,Fwas sued in the High Court in 2024 over
OL,13,Fclaims it misused people's personal
OL,14,Finformation.
OL,16,FThe class action suit was later served
OL,17,Fin the US, with the law firm leading
OL,18,Fthe case saying it had signed up more
OL,19,Fthan 11,000 claimants.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
